cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "glioma-transportability: external validation of TCGA-trained glioma survival models in CGGA"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rnmcln/glioma-transportability"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for developing overall-survival prediction models for adult
  diffuse glioma in TCGA and evaluating them unchanged in four CGGA releases,
  with separate assessment of discrimination and calibration, decomposition of
  the concordance index by molecular class, and a cross-validated recalibration
  ladder.
